#### Feature engineering: creating watch-time buckets
The code creates `watch_time_bck`, initially labels every row `Low`, then assigns `Med` to values from 1,000 to 4,000 inclusive and `High` to values above 4,000. This converts a numeric measure into categories that can be compared in grouped summaries.


df_cleaned['watch_time_bck'] = 'Low'  # Default bucket
df_cleaned.loc[df_cleaned['TotalTimeWatched'].between(1000, 4000),'watch_time_bck'] = 'Med'
df_cleaned.loc[df_cleaned['TotalTimeWatched'] >  4000, 'watch_time_bck'] = 'High'
display(df_cleaned)
